{
  "id": "quality-loop",
  "name": {
    "en": "Quality loop",
    "ru": "Цикл качества"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Review, add missing tests by layers, classify failures (test/code/env defect), diagnose code defects, fix and re-check. A whole-area quality pass, also schedulable at night.",
    "ru": "Ревью, добор недостающих тестов по слоям, классификация провалов (дефект теста / кода / окружения), диагноз дефектов кода, починка и перепроверка. Проход качества по области, можно по расписанию ночью."
  },
  "examples": {
    "ru": [
      "Прогони цикл качества по проекту: ревью, тесты, починка",
      "Подними качество всего проекта: найди проблемы, добавь покрытие, исправь",
      "Ночной проход качества по репозиторию",
      "Проверь всё, что накопилось, и приведи в порядок до зелёного",
      "Сделай полную проверку качества с исправлением дефектов",
      "Нужен общий аудит с тестами и починкой найденного"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Run a quality loop over the project: review, tests, fixes",
      "Raise the quality of the whole project: find problems, add coverage, fix them",
      "Nightly quality pass over the repository",
      "Check everything that has piled up and bring it to green",
      "Do a full quality sweep and fix the defects",
      "I want a general audit with tests and fixes for what it finds"
    ]
  },
  "not_for": [
    "review-fix",
    "code-review",
    "security-audit",
    "refactor"
  ],
  "status": "draft",
  "tags": [
    "code",
    "quality",
    "schedule"
  ],
  "inputs": {
    "scope": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "goal": {
      "type": "string",
      "default": "raise quality of the scope"
    },
    "quality_mode": {
      "type": "quick|standard|full",
      "default": "standard"
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "status": "done|partial|blocked",
    "rounds": "int",
    "tests_added": "int",
    "defects_fixed": "int",
    "env_issues": "string[]",
    "remaining": "Finding[]"
  },
  "quality_mode": {
    "default": "standard",
    "effect": "quick не допускается (минимум standard); full - слои тестов L0-L3 и браузер-проверка при UI",
    "min": "standard"
  },
  "requires": {
    "plugins": [
      "lane-pilot"
    ],
    "machines": [
      "project writer host"
    ],
    "project": {
      "git": true
    }
  },
  "triggers": [
    "chat",
    "schedule"
  ],
  "budget": {
    "max_steps": 100,
    "max_minutes": 480,
    "max_fan_out": 5
  },
  "entry": "review",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "review",
      "type": "subworkflow",
      "workflow": "lp.review",
      "with": {
        "files": [
          "{{$inputs.scope}}"
        ],
        "dimensions": {
          "by_mode": {
            "quick": [
              "correctness",
              "security"
            ],
            "standard": [
              "correctness",
              "security",
              "maintainability",
              "silent_failures"
            ],
            "full": [
              "correctness",
              "security",
              "performance",
              "architecture",
              "maintainability",
              "best_practices",
              "silent_failures"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coverage",
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "analyst",
      "title": {
        "en": "Find test gaps by layer",
        "ru": "Пробелы тестов по слоям"
      },
      "src": "maestro-flow:workflows/auto-test.md",
      "prompt": "List what is not covered: requirements/acceptance lines with no test, changed files with no test, edge cases (at most 5 per file). Assign each gap a layer - L0 static (tsc/lint), L1 unit, L2 integration, L3 e2e - and a priority (MUST critical, SHOULD high, MAY medium).\nRead-only. Do not change existing tests.\n",
      "out": {
        "gaps": "Gap[]",
        "gap_count": "int",
        "framework_found": "bool"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 2,
        "timeoutMin": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "test_gen",
      "type": "subworkflow",
      "workflow": "test-gen",
      "skip_when": "coverage.gap_count == 0 || !coverage.framework_found",
      "skip_out": {
        "status": "done",
        "tests_added": 0,
        "failures": "[]"
      },
      "with": {
        "gaps": "{{coverage.gaps}}",
        "scope": "{{$inputs.scope}}"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "classify",
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "triager",
      "title": {
        "en": "Classify failures",
        "ru": "Классифицировать провалы"
      },
      "src": "maestro-flow:workflows/auto-test.md",
      "prompt": "FAILURE_TRIAGE_METHOD. For every failing test decide test_defect (fix the test), code_defect (a confirmed bug in the code - do not retry, do not edit sources here) or env_issue (blocked). When in doubt - code_defect.\nFail-fast between layers: a critical failure in L1 stops L2, in L2 stops L3.\n",
      "out": {
        "failures": "Failure[]",
        "code_defects": "Finding[]",
        "test_defects": "int",
        "env_issues": "string[]",
        "code_defect_count": "int"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "diagnose",
      "type": "subworkflow",
      "workflow": "debug",
      "skip_when": "classify.code_defect_count == 0",
      "skip_out": {
        "status": "confirmed",
        "fix_directions": "[]",
        "diagnosis": ""
      },
      "with": {
        "symptom": "{{classify.code_defects}}",
        "mode": "from_failures"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "replan",
      "type": "subworkflow",
      "workflow": "lp.plan",
      "with": {
        "goal": "{{$inputs.goal}}",
        "mode": "gaps",
        "gaps": "{{review.findings}}",
        "findings": "{{diagnose}}"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "build",
      "type": "subworkflow",
      "workflow": "lp.build",
      "with": {
        "tasks": "{{replan.tasks}}",
        "waves": "{{replan.waves}}"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "qa",
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "browser-qa",
      "applicable_modes": [
        "full"
      ],
      "skip_when": "!replan.has_ui",
      "skip_out": {
        "status": "pass",
        "findings": "[]"
      },
      "prompt": "FRONTEND_VERIFY_METHOD over the fixed UI; silence is never pass.",
      "out": {
        "status": "pass|rework|block",
        "findings": "Finding[]"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask",
      "type": "human",
      "role": "owner",
      "title": {
        "en": "Still defects after two rounds",
        "ru": "Дефекты остались после двух кругов"
      },
      "prompt": "List remaining findings and env issues; offer accept as risk, plan a separate task, abort.",
      "out": {
        "answer": "string",
        "answer_kind": "accept|abort|timeout"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 1,
        "timeoutMin": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "done",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "emit",
      "map": {
        "status": "done",
        "rounds": "visits('build')",
        "tests_added": "test_gen.tests_added",
        "defects_fixed": "classify.code_defect_count",
        "env_issues": "classify.env_issues",
        "remaining": "[]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "partial",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "emit",
      "map": {
        "status": "partial",
        "rounds": "visits('build')",
        "tests_added": "test_gen.tests_added",
        "env_issues": "classify.env_issues",
        "remaining": "review.findings"
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "review",
      "to": "coverage",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "coverage",
      "to": "test_gen",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "test_gen",
      "to": "classify",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "classify",
      "to": "diagnose",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "when": "classify.code_defect_count > 0"
    },
    {
      "from": "classify",
      "to": "replan",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "when": "review.status == 'rework'"
    },
    {
      "from": "classify",
      "to": "done",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "diagnose",
      "to": "replan",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "replan",
      "to": "build",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "when": "replan.status in ['ok','low_confidence']"
    },
    {
      "from": "replan",
      "to": "ask",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "build",
      "to": "qa",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "when": "build.status == 'done'"
    },
    {
      "from": "build",
      "to": "ask",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "qa",
      "to": "review",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "when": "qa.status == 'pass' && visits('review') < 2",
      "label": "re-check"
    },
    {
      "from": "qa",
      "to": "done",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "when": "qa.status == 'pass'"
    },
    {
      "from": "qa",
      "to": "ask",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "ask",
      "to": "partial",
      "pass": "artifact"
    }
  ],
  "test": {
    "id": "ql-1",
    "sim": {
      "input": {
        "scope": "src/orders",
        "quality_mode": "standard"
      },
      "stubs": {
        "lp.review#1": {
          "status": "rework",
          "findings": [
            {
              "severity": "high",
              "file": "src/orders/total.ts",
              "line": 31
            }
          ]
        },
        "coverage": {
          "gap_count": 2,
          "framework_found": true
        },
        "test-gen": {
          "status": "done",
          "tests_added": 2
        },
        "classify": {
          "code_defect_count": 1,
          "failures": [
            {
              "class": "code_defect"
            }
          ]
        },
        "debug": {
          "status": "confirmed"
        },
        "lp.plan": {
          "status": "ok"
        },
        "lp.build": {
          "status": "done"
        },
        "lp.review#2": {
          "status": "pass"
        }
      },
      "expect_path": [
        "review",
        "coverage",
        "test_gen",
        "classify",
        "diagnose",
        "replan",
        "build",
        "qa",
        "review",
        "coverage",
        "test_gen",
        "classify",
        "done"
      ],
      "expect_outputs": [
        "status == 'done'",
        "tests_added == 4"
      ]
    },
    "live": "песочница: функция с известным багом в сумме корзины; цикл находит, дописывает тест, чинит, второй проход зелёный"
  }
}
